    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d335-a2">

                <pb facs="0489" n="369" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg369"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">General Sanchez to
                        Minister Dawson.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Dominican Republic,<lb/>Ministry of Foreign Relations</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">Santo Domingo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1905-04-06"><hi rendition="#italic">April 6,
                                1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Minister</hi>: I have the honor of communicating
                    to your excellency that the Dominican Government has accepted with real
                    satisfaction the designation made by His Excellency the President of the United
                    States in favor of Col. George R. Colton to receive the customs revenues of the
                    Republic in conformity with the first article of the resolution adopted on the
                    31st of March.</p>
                <p>By this notification I answer your excellency’s note of the 5th instant.</p>
                <p>I improve, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Juan Fco.
                    Sanchez.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
